    "title_en": "Non-planar corrections in the symmetric orbifold",
    "abstract_en": "We calculate the non-planar corrections to the anomalous dimensions of certain quarter BPS states in the symmetric product orbifold $\\text{Sym}^N\\big({\\mathbb{T}^4}\\big)$. We find that some of the degeneracies in the spectrum for large twist $w$ and large $N$ are lifted by these contributions. This suggests that integrability in the symmetric orbifold is broken by the non-planar (i.e. $\\frac{1}{N}$) corrections.",
